@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Melihat Data Mata Pelajaran (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Data Mata Pelajaran ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Mata Pelajaran"
UI -> C: 2. Request data mata pelajaran
C -> DB: 3. Get subjects data
DB --> C: 4. Return subjects list
C --> UI: 5. Load subjects page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan daftar mata pelajaran

@enduml